Subject: [PATCH 04/17] arm64: dts: renesas: r8a774c0: Add CAN nodes
Date:   Fri, 14 Dec 2018 09:37:27 +0000
Message-Id: <1544780260-27590-5-git-send-email-fabrizio.castro@bp.renesas.com>
